mike.sales: Thanks all. Action items: ingrid (runbook + code snippets), dhruv (cost model by EOD), elaine (short security note + KMS options). I'll consolidate and send to ACME. :thumbsup: 

sam.engineer: I'll be on standby during their first integration test tomorrow 09:00 PT.

mike.sales: Perfect — I'll loop in their engineering lead and schedule the call.
